# cursor-docs vault

Before writing a spec or plan, run the engine's `scripts/ensure-linked.sh` on
this code checkout. Do not ask first.

Write specs and plans under `cursor-docs/superpowers/specs/` and
`cursor-docs/superpowers/plans/`. That path is a symlink into the team's
private vault.

After changing those files or `registry.toml`, run `scripts/sync-vault.sh`
from the engine. Do not stage `links.local.toml`.

Do not commit the `cursor-docs` symlink in this code repository.
